{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（17日）早上9時21分，警方接獲途人報案，指一名20餘歲男子倒臥在荃灣西樓角路的行人天橋上，懷疑由高處墮下。救護員接報到場時事主昏迷，隨即將之送往仁濟醫院搶救，惜至9時42分不治。</p><p>現場是富華中心平台、通往港鐵荃灣站的一段行人天橋。警方初步相信事主由樓上一單位墮下，隨即由消防員帶同爆破工具上樓。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員帶備爆破工具上樓調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177195281373073408983501.jpeg/6XbwMLyDMJlfYJXdHq5pH7DzFQZCMMTOTsMUYGvDFGA\"/><figcaption>消防員帶備爆破工具上樓調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員調查事主身份。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177195278256574464978614.jpeg/pi0xkPsQ8Xmxy0CrLntqA7gFeL9zgb03zWUduehlHbk\"/><figcaption>警員調查事主身份。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場檢視可疑物品。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177197451187064832379642.jpeg/ign7eP1vsC_YNRFkDDST40zOhaTp2SORajtahE87WoQ\"/><figcaption>警員在場檢視可疑物品。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖一段行人路。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177197454219677696239705.jpeg/2nVU5XKNDRVzh0gtzO--Vx1ZMwSSvbaooEt5EYVLeRE\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖一段行人路。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在大廈調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177198072938106880248603.jpeg/lpbeWagFZH2Xs0QzDDTyk-aG4ZWHGWE9t1eExJJXhMQ\"/><figcaption>警員在大廈調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是青山公路荃灣段富華中心。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177198675395350528164802.jpeg/2qgIhnvixpSqeiM9ihW3okZX4-RCCjGIPdU0EBjVNBA\"/><figcaption>現場是青山公路荃灣段富華中心。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:59:42.148891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}